    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/18cf6f0fd335669ca70d428e86d0036a.poster.avif?t=1755368166\" width=800 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/18cf6f0fd335669ca70d428e86d0036a.webm?t=1755368166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/18cf6f0fd335669ca70d428e86d0036a.mp4?t=1755368166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this chaotic, physics-based platformer, you and your pals are undead cowboys in a desperate race toward the sky. Trapped in a decaying Wild West, you must climb higher and higher, overcoming deadly obstacles and unstable platforms with only each other to rely on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/1d260d8e852743cb6998777047a1a099.poster.avif?t=1755368166\" width=800 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/1d260d8e852743cb6998777047a1a099.webm?t=1755368166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/1d260d8e852743cb6998777047a1a099.mp4?t=1755368166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your gun not just to shoot, but to launch your pals across gaps, up cliffs, and into danger. Sometimes, the only way up... is to shoot your pal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/1fb2603ec2cbddc3c5148bf2b6986f1b.poster.avif?t=1755368166\" width=800 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/1fb2603ec2cbddc3c5148bf2b6986f1b.webm?t=1755368166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/1fb2603ec2cbddc3c5148bf2b6986f1b.mp4?t=1755368166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not into platforming? No problem\u2014Party Mode is here! Compete in various mini-games and prove you're the new sheriff in town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/d001dfbc4c5b6d17730cbc6af0d80453.poster.avif?t=1755368166\" width=800 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/d001dfbc4c5b6d17730cbc6af0d80453.webm?t=1755368166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/d001dfbc4c5b6d17730cbc6af0d80453.mp4?t=1755368166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-driven 3D platforming gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to 4 players in online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch your pals or yourself to new heights by bouncing your bullets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your zombie cowboy with cosmetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A darkly humorous journey from the grave to the clouds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive Party Mode for chaotic fun with friends</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/0546b5ea80744776635366d986c617ec.poster.avif?t=1755368166\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/0546b5ea80744776635366d986c617ec.webm?t=1755368166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/0546b5ea80744776635366d986c617ec.mp4?t=1755368166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you and your pals escape this undead purgatory? Or will the climb break your bodies \u2014 and your friendships?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/18cf6f0fd335669ca70d428e86d0036a.poster.avif?t=1755368166\" width=800 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/18cf6f0fd335669ca70d428e86d0036a.webm?t=1755368166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/18cf6f0fd335669ca70d428e86d0036a.mp4?t=1755368166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this chaotic, physics-based platformer, you and your pals are undead cowboys in a desperate race toward the sky. Trapped in a decaying Wild West, you must climb higher and higher, overcoming deadly obstacles and unstable platforms with only each other to rely on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/1d260d8e852743cb6998777047a1a099.poster.avif?t=1755368166\" width=800 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/1d260d8e852743cb6998777047a1a099.webm?t=1755368166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/1d260d8e852743cb6998777047a1a099.mp4?t=1755368166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your gun not just to shoot, but to launch your pals across gaps, up cliffs, and into danger. Sometimes, the only way up... is to shoot your pal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/1fb2603ec2cbddc3c5148bf2b6986f1b.poster.avif?t=1755368166\" width=800 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/1fb2603ec2cbddc3c5148bf2b6986f1b.webm?t=1755368166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/1fb2603ec2cbddc3c5148bf2b6986f1b.mp4?t=1755368166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not into platforming? No problem\u2014Party Mode is here! Compete in various mini-games and prove you're the new sheriff in town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/d001dfbc4c5b6d17730cbc6af0d80453.poster.avif?t=1755368166\" width=800 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/d001dfbc4c5b6d17730cbc6af0d80453.webm?t=1755368166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/d001dfbc4c5b6d17730cbc6af0d80453.mp4?t=1755368166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-driven 3D platforming gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to 4 players in online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch your pals or yourself to new heights by bouncing your bullets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your zombie cowboy with cosmetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A darkly humorous journey from the grave to the clouds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive Party Mode for chaotic fun with friends</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/0546b5ea80744776635366d986c617ec.poster.avif?t=1755368166\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/0546b5ea80744776635366d986c617ec.webm?t=1755368166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/0546b5ea80744776635366d986c617ec.mp4?t=1755368166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you and your pals escape this undead purgatory? Or will the climb break your bodies \u2014 and your friendships?</p>",
